WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.396 --> 00:00:03.186
Unit four. My House!

2
00:00:04.203 --> 00:00:09.111
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Sophea. Welcome back!

3
00:00:09.161 --> 00:00:12.911
Hi, Teacher Sophea! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.961 --> 00:00:16.301
Today we learn: My House. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.339 --> 00:00:20.889
Kitchen. Say it with me. Kitchen!

6
00:00:24.393 --> 00:00:28.009
Bedroom. Say it with me. Bedroom!

7
00:00:31.499 --> 00:00:35.199
Bathroom. Say it with me. Bathroom!

8
00:00:38.698 --> 00:00:42.515
Garden. Say it with me. Garden!

9
00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:49.393
Roof. Say it with me. Roof!

10
00:00:52.899 --> 00:00:56.232
Window. Say it with me. Window!

11
00:00:59.732 --> 00:01:03.632
Sofa. Say it with me. Sofa!

12
00:01:07.132 --> 00:01:10.566
Table. Say it with me. Table!

13
00:01:14.091 --> 00:01:18.007
Balcony. Say it with me. Balcony!

14
00:01:21.490 --> 00:01:25.556
Stairs. Say it with me. Stairs!

15
00:01:29.053 --> 00:01:32.803
Fence. Say it with me. Fence!

16
00:01:36.290 --> 00:01:40.090
Yard. Say it with me. Yard!

17
00:01:43.607 --> 00:01:52.971
Grammar time! There is  or  There are. Listen. There is a garden. There are two bedrooms.

18
00:01:53.021 --> 00:01:58.720
Your turn. Say it with me. There is a garden. There are two bedrooms.

19
00:02:03.661 --> 00:02:09.378
My house has a kitchen, two bedrooms and a bathroom. We grow flowers in the garden.

20
00:02:09.428 --> 00:02:10.774
I like this story!

21
00:02:11.470 --> 00:02:16.723
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:16.773 --> 00:02:17.923
Bathroom!

23
00:02:18.928 --> 00:02:24.233
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:24.283 --> 00:02:25.433
Sofa!

25
00:02:26.525 --> 00:02:34.532
Think and answer. What is your favorite room in your house?

26
00:02:34.582 --> 00:02:35.732
Great answer!

27
00:02:36.814 --> 00:02:39.290
This unit's value is Gratitude.

28
00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:41.224
I can show gratitude every day!

29
00:02:41.914 --> 00:02:46.755
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

30
00:02:46.805 --> 00:02:48.521
Bye-bye, friends!

